From 7bed9e7682c30a122d5b22e044f413fb48a03e0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:25:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] occamy-fused: MOE_V3X2 two-row fused MoE (union of experts) +
 DB direct-load phase B

- moe_v3x2: both verify rows in one launch; router read once, union of routed experts
  walked once in phase B, down per row. Opt-in GGML_CUDA_MOE_V3X2=1 (default off),
  GGML_CUDA_MOE_V3X2_CHECK=n compares against the split path bitwise.
- GGML_CUDA_MOE_V3X2_DB=1: phase B loads each lane's 36 B straight from global and
  fuses the gate/up dots (shared xs reads); same FMA order -> bitwise identical.
- GGML_CUDA_MOE_PHASE_TIME=n: globaltimer per-phase timing (debug, serialises).
- test-backend-ops: OCCAMY_MOE nt/mix cases; whole-graph perf runs once per pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012TpXXDKesx6WqrHo8bCYxx
